        "type": "string",
        "description": "Normalised name per the short rule list in extract_prompt_v1_1.md (gene symbol / common abbreviation, e.g. IL-6, TNF-alpha, CRP, sIgA, leukocyte count; replaces v1 standard_name). Bare missing code if the analyte itself is unnamed (e.g. a universe/summary row)."
